1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,719
Ooh! Cold toes!

2
00:00:01,719 --> 00:00:02,815
Cold toes!

3
00:00:03,065 --> 00:00:04,546
Hop, hop, hop!

4
00:00:05,096 --> 00:00:07,827
What can I put on my cold toes?

5
00:00:08,077 --> 00:00:09,327
Shout it out!

6
00:00:11,327 --> 00:00:14,481
Socks! Warm, cosy socks!

7
00:00:16,331 --> 00:00:19,273
It's my sleepover at your house, Mimi.

8
00:00:19,523 --> 00:00:22,427
But my toes are too chilly to sleep!

9
00:00:22,977 --> 00:00:24,660
Don't worry, Pip.

10
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:27,438
I have a basket full of socks!

11
00:00:27,688 --> 00:00:29,227
Meow!

12
00:00:31,077 --> 00:00:32,594
Wow! So many socks!

13
00:00:32,594 --> 00:00:33,904
Which one first?

14
00:00:34,454 --> 00:00:34,913
Pick one, Pip!

15
00:00:34,913 --> 00:00:35,454
Pull, pull, pull!

16
00:00:37,154 --> 00:00:39,750
Ta-da! I'm all ready for bed!

17
00:00:40,150 --> 00:00:41,175
Hee hee!

18
00:00:41,175 --> 00:00:43,227
A sock on your ear?

19
00:00:43,477 --> 00:00:46,400
Does a sock go on your ear?

20
00:00:48,400 --> 00:00:50,688
No! Socks go on your feet!

21
00:00:50,938 --> 00:00:52,111
Silly me!

22
00:00:53,961 --> 00:00:57,154
Let's play a sock colour game!

23
00:00:57,704 --> 00:01:00,415
What colour is this sock?

24
00:01:02,415 --> 00:01:04,800
Red! With little white hearts!

25
00:01:06,650 --> 00:01:07,642
And this one?

26
00:01:07,642 --> 00:01:08,573
What colour?

27
00:01:10,573 --> 00:01:12,769
Yellow! With orange dots,

28
00:01:12,769 --> 00:01:14,573
like little oranges!

29
00:01:16,423 --> 00:01:17,863
Stripy, stripy!

30
00:01:17,863 --> 00:01:21,384
What colour are the stripes on this sock?

31
00:01:23,384 --> 00:01:24,596
Green and white!

32
00:01:24,596 --> 00:01:25,000
Like a candy stick!

33
00:01:28,650 --> 00:01:30,093
Ooh, my favourite!

34
00:01:30,093 --> 00:01:31,880
Blue with yellow stars!

35
00:01:32,130 --> 00:01:34,323
Count the stars with me!

36
00:01:36,123 --> 00:01:38,603
One, two, three stars!

37
00:01:40,403 --> 00:01:42,321
Socks come in twos.

38
00:01:42,321 --> 00:01:44,499
Two socks make a pair!

39
00:01:45,049 --> 00:01:46,553
Red and red.

40
00:01:46,553 --> 00:01:48,357
Is that a pair?

41
00:01:48,607 --> 00:01:50,723
Yes or no?

42
00:01:52,723 --> 00:01:54,336
Yes! Two red socks!

43
00:01:54,336 --> 00:01:55,069
A pair!

44
00:01:56,919 --> 00:01:58,153
Yellow and green.

45
00:01:58,153 --> 00:01:59,265
Is that a pair?

46
00:02:01,265 --> 00:02:03,371
No! They don't match.

47
00:02:03,371 --> 00:02:04,688
Silly socks!

48
00:02:06,538 --> 00:02:08,191
Now we have pairs!

49
00:02:08,191 --> 00:02:10,711
How many pairs can you count?

50
00:02:12,911 --> 00:02:15,815
One, two, three pairs!

51
00:02:16,315 --> 00:02:19,238
Look, I put on one blue star sock.

52
00:02:19,488 --> 00:02:22,103
But where is the other blue sock?

53
00:02:25,403 --> 00:02:27,172
Is it under the rug?

54
00:02:27,172 --> 00:02:27,634
No.

55
00:02:29,684 --> 00:02:33,242
Listen! What is that jingle in my bed?

56
00:02:36,342 --> 00:02:37,548
My blue sock!

57
00:02:37,548 --> 00:02:39,207
It's in Mimi's bed!

58
00:02:39,757 --> 00:02:40,213
Oh!

59
00:02:40,213 --> 00:02:44,853
My yarn ball was snuggled inside it like a little blanket!

60
00:02:45,103 --> 00:02:46,757
Hee hee!

61
00:02:48,607 --> 00:02:50,090
One sock, two socks!

62
00:02:50,090 --> 00:02:51,895
Wiggle your toes with me!

63
00:02:53,695 --> 00:02:56,618
Ahh! My toes are warm and cosy now!

64
00:02:57,168 --> 00:02:59,091
Mine too!

65
00:03:00,941 --> 00:03:04,412
Who wants a warm milk cuddle before bed?

66
00:03:04,962 --> 00:03:05,631
Me! Me!

67
00:03:05,631 --> 00:03:06,433
Pad, pad,

68
00:03:06,433 --> 00:03:07,770
pad in our socks!

69
00:03:08,320 --> 00:03:11,160
I made it just warm, not hot.

70
00:03:11,410 --> 00:03:13,473
Stay close to me.

71
00:03:14,023 --> 00:03:16,668
How many cups are on the table?

72
00:03:18,668 --> 00:03:20,450
Two! One for Pip,

73
00:03:20,450 --> 00:03:22,053
and one for me!

74
00:03:23,903 --> 00:03:26,576
Mmm! What do we say to Mama Bunny?

75
00:03:28,576 --> 00:03:29,981
Thank you!

76
00:03:29,981 --> 00:03:30,845
Meow!

77
00:03:31,395 --> 00:03:33,561
Now a big, cosy cuddle.

78
00:03:33,561 --> 00:03:34,728
Look, soft,

79
00:03:34,728 --> 00:03:37,560
sleepy snow is falling outside.

80
00:03:39,410 --> 00:03:42,545
Time for a sleepy kitten stretch!

81
00:03:42,795 --> 00:03:45,564
Paws up high, high, high!

82
00:03:47,564 --> 00:03:50,006
Now wiggle your warm toes.

83
00:03:50,256 --> 00:03:51,660
Wiggle, wiggle!

84
00:03:54,560 --> 00:03:56,200
Now slow breaths.

85
00:03:56,200 --> 00:03:57,347
Breathe in,

86
00:03:57,347 --> 00:03:59,560
like smelling warm milk.

87
00:04:01,560 --> 00:04:02,900
And breathe out,

88
00:04:02,900 --> 00:04:04,099
slow and soft.

89
00:04:04,349 --> 00:04:05,156
Ahh.

90
00:04:08,656 --> 00:04:09,523
Yes, Moon!

91
00:04:09,523 --> 00:04:11,791
Let's sing the Warm Socks Song!

92
00:04:12,041 --> 00:04:13,445
Wiggle along!

93
00:04:15,295 --> 00:04:17,040
One sock, two socks,

94
00:04:17,040 --> 00:04:18,102
on my feet.

95
00:04:18,352 --> 00:04:19,747
Wiggle, wiggle,

96
00:04:19,747 --> 00:04:21,064
toes so sweet!

97
00:04:21,664 --> 00:04:23,936
Red socks, blue socks,

98
00:04:23,936 --> 00:04:25,298
find a pair.

99
00:04:25,548 --> 00:04:28,587
Warm and cosy everywhere!

100
00:04:30,487 --> 00:04:32,476
Warm socks, cosy socks,

101
00:04:32,476 --> 00:04:33,852
snug and tight.

102
00:04:34,102 --> 00:04:36,756
Warm socks help me sleep tonight!

103
00:04:38,856 --> 00:04:40,845
Warm socks, cosy socks,

104
00:04:40,845 --> 00:04:42,222
snug and tight.

105
00:04:42,472 --> 00:04:45,125
Warm socks help me sleep tonight!

106
00:04:45,925 --> 00:04:48,637
Yawn! Goodnight, Pip.

107
00:04:49,037 --> 00:04:50,413
Goodnight, Mimi.

108
00:04:50,413 --> 00:04:52,152
Goodnight, warm toes.

109
00:04:54,052 --> 00:04:58,047
Wiggle your toes and say goodnight with me.

110
00:04:58,297 --> 00:04:59,841
Goodnight!

111
00:05:01,441 --> 00:05:05,309
Share with a friend and subscribe to Honey Bunny Kidz!

112
00:05:05,909 --> 00:05:06,752
Next time,

113
00:05:06,752 --> 00:05:10,839
Pip Puppy counts five little snowflakes in a brand new song!

114
00:05:11,439 --> 00:05:13,360
Sweet dreams, friends!

115
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:16,512
See you next time on Honey Bunny Kidz!
